        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Mmm～～......</Dialog>
          <Dialog>？？？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hyah！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Mmm～～... what？ A pillow？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲高嶺＊＊▲... what are you
doing？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Takane</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Pillow fight♪ We still
haven't decided who won,
right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Did we... I mean, why are
you wearing your uniform？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Why？ Because it's the
school trip！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>？？？ I'm getting kind of
confused...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Still up？ Lights-out was
ages ago！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Who's that？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh no, we have to hide!!
Over here, quick！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh, why!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>.........</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲Takane＊＊▲？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Shh... they'll hear！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm sorry... But, why are 
we hiding in the closet？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Because when you hide from a
teacher, it's the closet,
right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A teacher!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Teacher</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Nobody here？ I definitely
heard voices just now.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A teacher... huh？ But
wasn't ▲高嶺＊＊▲ the
student, and I was the
teacher？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>That's the vice principal.
You know, my papa.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What the heck!? That's
news to me...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Manaka's Dad</Dialog>
          <Dialog>And here I thought you were
a promising young man...
What a naughty boy you are.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What do we do, Papa's really
angry... I bet he's making a
face like an ogre.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Any naughty kids
arooound...？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...N-Namahage？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I told you before, right？
My papa's 15th dan in kendo
and the Way of Namahage
combined...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm pretty sure the Namahage
part is news to me...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Heh, I see？ If that's how
it's going to be, I'll just
have to let this do the
talking.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Th-that sounded kind of
dangerous...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Papa, what dan are you in
the Way of the Rifle
again...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A r-rifle!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hey... maybe the only way
now is for you to take
responsibility for me, right
here...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>R-responsibility, meaning...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You know what I mean...
meanie.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲高嶺＊＊▲... no, no！
This isn't the time for――</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hey, please, I'm waiting 
for you...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Aaah～！ When you say that,
dressed like that... argh！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Come▼</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲Takane＊＊▲！！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ow!!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A dream... that was
surreal...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes, Sensei... hehe▼</Dialog>
          <Dialog>......</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I'm beat... I'll go back to
sleep too...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Are you okay？ You were
having some weird
nightmare...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I'm so tired...)</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
      </SDL2>
