        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Haah～～！ What a nice
bath！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(▲高嶺＊＊▲... still not
out？)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(This is way too long... did
she go back to the room
first？)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm back. ▲高嶺＊＊▲, you
here？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Takane</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeees♪</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Hm？ Her voice is coming
from the room's open-air
bath...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲Takane＊＊▲？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What is it？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, you were in here？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>That's right. Hah, it 
feels so good... Hey... 
Do you want to join me？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh!? ...But is that
okay？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah, you're blushing. Hehe,
you're funny.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah, I get it！ You're
wearing a swimsuit！ Then...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa！ You're not wearing
one！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It's a hot spring？ Normally
you don't wear one, right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well, when you put it that
way, sure, but... just a
towel？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>As you can see. Hehe♪</Dialog>
          <Dialog>As I can see... I can't
really see well...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Then if I look from a
little more to the side...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Steam!! Stupid steam！)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(At a time like this... I
know, I'll blow on it！)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Argh！ Cursed steam！)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What's wrong？ Hurry, come
in？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>R-really？ Then...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh？ Why is there glass...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh... what, why？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Huh？ No, I was trying to
get in with you――</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No way... this is the
women's bath...
unbelievable！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>The women's bath!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Eek！ Teacher！ A boy！ A
boy is peeking！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Wait！ There's a reason for
this!!</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
